00:30:00,384 --> 00:30:04,402
and Jibreel(جِبْرِيْل) descended on Muhammadﷺ, Zaid Bin Harissa(زيد بن حارثه) said:

373
00:30:04,442 --> 00:30:09,989
I felt the weight of the knee of Rasool Allah ﷺ and it was almost going to crush my thigh.

