huge, he would cover the horizon,

386
00:31:03,307 --> 00:31:09,991
in fact Rasool Allah ﷺ said: Wherever he would look, he would see the wings of the angel of Jibreel(جِبْرِيْل) in front of him,

387
00:31:10,561 --> 00:31:12,504
covering the horizon in every direction.

388
00:31:14,044 --> 00:31:16,045
Finally, the six

