391
00:31:29,399 --> 00:31:36,162
Rasool Allah ﷺ spoke directly to Allah سبحانه وتعالى and Allah spoke directly to Muhammadﷺ,

392
00:31:36,237 --> 00:31:40,244
and this form actually also occurred to Musa عليه السّلام.

393
00:31:40,943 --> 00:31:46,059
So, these are the seven(six) different forms of Revelation.

