00:31:46,742 --> 00:31:52,621
Rasool Allah ﷺ initially was instructed to keep the message private,

395
00:31:53,560 --> 00:31:55,937
not to make it public.

396
00:31:56,965 --> 00:32:00,764
And to invite only his very close associates.

