00:32:01,417 --> 00:32:06,032
So Rasool Allah ﷺ made Da'wah(دعوة) to the ones, who were very close to him.

398
00:32:06,528 --> 00:32:11,564
The first person to believe out of both men and woman

399
00:32:12,011 --> 00:32:16,711
was Khadijahرضي الله عنها, she was the first believer.

400
00:32:17,267 --> 00:32:18,806
Ibn Kathir(اِبْنِ كَثِيْر) says:

401
00:32:19,298 --> 00:32:25,180
Combining these accounts we see that Khadijah(خديجه) was the first woman to accept Islam,

402
00:32:25,570 --> 00:32:30,825
the leader of the pack, as it were, and also she proceeded the men.

403
00:32:31,325 --> 00:32:35,079
She was the first to believe in Muhammadﷺ.

404
00:32:35,729 --> 00:32:38,216
Now we talked about Khadijahرضي الله عنها

405
00:32:38,294 --> 00:32:44,382
and we talked earlier about the marriage of Rasool Allah ﷺ to Khadijahرضي الله عنها.

406
00:32:45,165 --> 00:32:47,615
Now, what made Khadijah(خديجه) special?

407
00:32:48,466 --> 00:32:52,359
How come she was one of the greatest woman that ever lived?

408
00:32:53,688 --> 00:32:56,719
Was it because of her career, was it because of her knowledge?

409
00:32:56,870 --> 00:32:58,394
What was it exactly?

410
00:32:59,144 --> 00:33:03,509
That made Khadijah(خديجه) among the four best women that ever lived.?

411
00:33:03,703 --> 00:33:06,798
I think we should give this some consideration.

412
00:33:07,425 --> 00:33:13,472
And especially the sisters should revisit the text regarding Khadijahرضي الله عنها

413
00:33:13,512 --> 00:33:16,692
and the other three women which were mentioned in the Hadith(حديث),

414
00:33:17,037 --> 00:33:18,941
Mariyam(مريم), Aasiya(آسيه) and Fatima(فاطمه).

415
00:33:20,294 --> 00:33:24,151
If we want to find something in common between these four women,

416
00:33:24,791 --> 00:33:26,187
we would find the following.

417
00:33:26,691 --> 00:33:27,588
1) Number one.

418
00:33:28,651 --> 00:33:34,325
All of the four had a solid spiritual heart,

419
00:33:34,810 --> 00:33:37,865
they had some strong spirituality.

420
00:33:38,643 --> 00:33:42,196
Their Eeman(إيمان) was powerful, their Eeman(إيمان) was solid,

421
00:33:42,319 --> 00:33:46,761
that is something that is clearly seen in the case of the four,

422
00:33:47,085 --> 00:33:49,465
they had strong, Eeman(إيمان).

423
00:33:50,344 --> 00:33:54,189
And their faith in Allahعَزّوجَلّ reached to the level of Yaqeen(يقين).

424
00:33:54,902 --> 00:33:57,550
Yaqeen(يقين) is a state of conviction

425
00:33:57,920 --> 00:34:00,713
where nothing can bring doubts into the heart.

426
00:34:01,080 --> 00:34:08,181
So, the heart has absorbed Eeman(ايمان) to a level where it makes the heart unshakable that is Yaqeen(يقين).

427
00:34:08,744 --> 00:34:16,209
It is strong to the extent that one would have more faith in what they believe

428
00:34:16,248 --> 00:34:19,023
 than what they would see or hear, that is Yaqeen(يقين).

429
00:34:19,612 --> 00:34:23,385
It is, as if you see something in front of your eyes, even though you don't see it.

430
00:34:23,924 --> 00:34:25,098
That is the level of Yaqeen(يقين).

431
00:34:25,431 --> 00:34:29,105
It is clear that all of these four had that level of Eeman(ايمان).

432
00:34:30,256 --> 00:34:34,446
I mean, Let's look for example, take an example Aasiyah(آسيه),

433
00:34:35,184 --> 00:34:37,575
 Aasiyah(آسيه) the wife of Firaun(فرعون).

434
00:34:38,437 --> 00:34:44,483
Aasiyah(آسيه), had all what a worldly woman would want

435
00:34:44,806 --> 00:34:48,936
A woman who's concerned is this Duniyah(دُنِيَّا), would want wealth,

436
00:34:49,047 --> 00:34:53,968
 would want a very comfortable living, would want to have a rich and powerful husband

437
00:34:54,007 --> 00:34:57,867
would want to have servants, would want to have power, she had it all.

438
00:34:59,299 --> 00:35:03,777
Aasiyah(آسيه) was willing to give up all of this for the sake of Allahعَزّ وجَلّ.

439
00:35:05,259 --> 00:35:09,301
Allah سبحانه وتعالى has put her in a place

440
00:35:10,413 --> 00:35:13,504
in a palace, that was the best in the world.

441
00:35:14,012 --> 00:35:16,734
She said: O Allah I want a house in Jannah(جنة),

442
00:35:17,320 --> 00:35:23,617
وَضَرَبَ اللَّهُ مَثَلًا لِلَّذِينَ آمَنُوا امْرَأَتَ فِرْعَوْنَ

443
00:35:23,882 --> 00:35:30,031
إِذْ قَالَتْ رَبِّ ابْنِ لِي عِنْدَكَ بَيْتًا فِي الْجَنَّةِ

444
00:35:30,345 --> 00:35:38,575
وَنَجِّنِي مِنْ فِرْعَوْنَ وَعَمَلِهِ وَنَجِّنِي مِنَ الْقَوْمِ الظَّالِمِينَ۝

445
00:35:39,529 --> 00:35:42,262
O Allah, I don't want this, I want something in Jannah(جنة)

446
00:35:43,291 --> 00:35:49,291
Allah سبحانه وتعالى has given her the most powerful and wealthiest husband.

447
00:35:49,592 --> 00:35:51,061
She said, I don't want this,

448
00:35:51,474 --> 00:35:53,660
وَنَجِّنِي مِنْ فِرْعَوْنَ وَعَمَلِهِ

449
00:35:53,741 --> 00:35:58,682
And Allah save me from Firaun(فرعون) and all of his deeds, I don't want to have anything to do with it.

450
00:35:59,534 --> 00:36:07,828
So, that willingness to give up, all of these worldly aspects for the sake of Allah is a reflection of the depth of her faith.

451
00:36:08,740 --> 00:36:14,495
Now, keep in mind that Aasiyah(آسيه) was living in a very evil and corrupt environment,

452
00:36:15,188 --> 00:36:17,962
