453
00:36:18,835 --> 00:36:24,338
Nevertheless, she was able to overcome all of her surroundings and attached her heart to Allah.

454
00:36:24,973 --> 00:36:27,196
That's another indication of the strength of Eeman(ايمان),

455
00:36:27,415 --> 00:36:32,166
that you are able to fight the tide which is surrounding you from every direction

456
00:36:32,576 --> 00:36:34,216
and keep your connection to Allah.

457
00:36:35,683 --> 00:36:39,360
And we could say the same, about all of the rest.

458
00:36:39,478 --> 00:36:45,483
So number one, they had deep faith in Allahسبحانه وتعالى that reach the level of Yaqeen(يقين).

459
00:36:46,100 --> 00:36:48,930
The second common thing that we find among them,

460
00:36:49,952 --> 00:36:56,697
is that all of the four were either good wives, or good mothers.

