495
00:39:36,998 --> 00:39:41,072
This was his only surviving child and he loved her dearly.

496
00:39:41,543 --> 00:39:43,105
He loved her so much.

497
00:39:45,035 --> 00:39:48,977
So, Rasool Allah ﷺ would want to do for his daughter what is best for her,

498
00:39:50,032 --> 00:39:52,192
