506
00:40:19,961 --> 00:40:22,321
Now Rasool Allah ﷺ knew that his daughter

507
00:40:23,061 --> 00:40:27,347
the daughter of the best and she is, of the best.

508
00:40:28,513 --> 00:40:34,278
Rasool Allah ﷺ knew that she was serving in a household until her hands became harsh,

