538
00:42:52,678 --> 00:42:55,944
we know the first woman was Khadijah(خديجه), and she was first among everyone.

539
00:42:56,235 --> 00:43:00,468
But among men, who was the first was it Abu Bakr(ابوبكر), or Ali(علي).

